Model-generated text in the evaluation data
  pd-experiment/judged.jsonl
  pd-experiment/analysis/VALIDATION_adopt_reject.md

  These files reproduce text generated by third-party language models that were
  run as evaluation subjects or as the scoring judge, accessed through the
  Dreadnode platform. Solver models come from Zhipu (GLM), DeepSeek, Alibaba
  (Qwen), Moonshot (Kimi) and Meta (Llama); the scoring judge is Anthropic
  Claude. The text is reproduced here as research data so the published codings
  can be checked against their source.

  Dreadnode claims no ownership of this generated text. Use of it is subject to
  the terms of the provider that generated it. The MIT grant in LICENSE covers
  this repository's own code, task definitions, rubrics, documentation and
  derived codings, not the underlying model output.

